							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>1</arrivalTick>
						<text>一份来自叶小羊的特别礼物被投放到了殖民地附近。感谢你游玩并支持这个模组。</text>
						<quest>null</quest>
